# Social banners only — never touch the live header or footer

When the user wants a JoyRider, WrapStar, WrapRider, or shopper image for X, Facebook, LinkedIn, or any other post:

- Give them the **banner JPEG URL** to copy and paste.
- JoyRider first when the post is about delivery: `https://api.wrrapd.com/img/og/wrrapd-x-joyrider-e.jpg`
- WrapStar: `https://api.wrrapd.com/img/og/wrrapd-x-wrapstar-e.jpg`
- WrapRider: `https://api.wrrapd.com/img/og/wrrapd-x-wraprider-e.jpg`

Full table: [docs/SOCIAL-SHARE-CARDS.md](../../docs/SOCIAL-SHARE-CARDS.md).

## Forbidden

- Do not replace the header logo, the footer logo, or any other image shoppers see.
- Do not rewrite `Wrrapd_f-Logo`, `cropped-Wrrapd`, or `Applications_Wrrapd` in page HTML, for bots or for people.
- Do not install a plugin that runs on every page view to “fix” share cards.

Open Graph meta tags may point at the banner. The visible site stays the wordmark.
